# tests/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the backend CI gate
# (`--target backend-test`) copies it. No stage that is pushed copies it, so the
# runtime image still ships without tests.
# The frontend is built inside the image's first stage from source. Never ship
# a host build or a host node_modules into it.
